lass=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为被告知归属的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 方的延误天数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为对应阶梯费率。份额之和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 是有意为之：无法举证的延误天数（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\beta_i &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的部分）在商业上由自己吸收，在争议中则必须由承运人举证费用的补偿性用途。2026 年 7 月，美国哥伦比亚特区巡回上诉法院维持了 FMC 的一项裁定，明确<strong>承运人负有举证责任</strong>证明其费用服务于补偿性目的，而非把举证负担推给货方（FMC 新闻稿，2026-07-08）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"车队责任切片-merchant-haulage-下的-detention-归属\">车队责任切片：merchant haulage 下的 Detention 归属</h2><p>Detention 的责任争议几乎总是发生在 <strong>merchant haulage</strong> 场景——收货人自行委托车队提箱，集装箱出闸后进入货方控制，D&amp;D 中的 Detention 时钟随即启动。此时链条上出现两个新的责任主体：收货人（委托方）与车队（执行方）。直觉上&quot;箱子在车队手里就该车队赔&quot;，但法律与商业惯例都不是这么切的。</p>\n<p>FMC 在 2026 年维持的那起案件就落在这一层：一家卡车公司因港口在节假日周末关闭三天而未能及时还箱，被海运承运人收取 Detention，FMC 认定该费用不合理——因为船司停摆期间货方客观上无法还箱，费用无法达到促进流转的目的，特区巡回法院驳回了承运人的上诉（FMC 新闻稿，2026-07-08）。由此可以归纳出车队场景的三条归属规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>闸口拒收免责</strong>：还箱点（return location）在约定时段内关闭、预约额度已满或无理由拒收，由此产生的 Detention 归承运人 / 堆场一侧。</li>\n<li><strong>货方原因自担</strong>：拆箱延误、内陆仓储滞留、委托方指令延迟，归收货人或其代理。</li>\n<li><strong>举证决定谁付</strong>：谁主张免责，谁就要拿出闸口日志、预约系统截图、门禁记录——这与 § 541.6 要求发票标注&quot;被开票方为正当权益方的依据&quot;是同一条逻辑的两端（46 CFR § 541.6）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"合同前置-把责任分配写进条款而非事后吵\">合同前置：把责任分配写进条款而非事后吵</h2><p>事后追偿的成本远高于事前约定，因此成熟的做法是在三类文件里预先切分 D&amp;D 责任：<strong>海运服务合同</strong>（约定 free time、D&amp;D 上限、是否可转嫁）、<strong>货代服务条款</strong>（约定哪些费用 pass-through、转嫁时限、是否加收服务费）、<strong>拖车运输合同</strong>（约定还箱责任、不可抗力与闸口拒收的免责）。下表把责任分配条款的落点与常见陷阱对照。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>应明确的 D&amp;D 条款</th>\n<th>常见陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>海运服务合同</td>\n<td>free time 天数、D&amp;D 日费率与上限、开票对象</td>\n<td>只写运费率，D&amp;D 依赖默认 tariff</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>货代服务条款</td>\n<td>pass-through 清单、转嫁时限、服务费口径</td>\n<td>未约定转嫁时限，触发 § 541.7 逾期免责</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拖车运输合同</td>\n<td>还箱责任、闸口拒收免责、不可抗力定义</td>\n<td>只写运价，未定义&quot;还箱完成&quot;的时间点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个工程化的做法是把责任矩阵做成结构化数据，让系统在生成转嫁账单时自动匹配：规则引擎按&quot;事件类型 × 责任主体 × 合同条款&quot;输出归属份额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而不是由人工在邮件里争论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"争议与坏账-转嫁失败后的追偿路径\">争议与坏账：转嫁失败后的追偿路径</h2><p>转嫁不是终点。当收货人拒付、车队主张免责、承运人不接受抗辩时，账单会沉淀为坏账或进入正式争议程序。按 46 CFR § 541.8，被开票方自发票签发日起至少拥有 <strong>30 个日历日</strong>提出减免、退款或豁免请求，开票方须在 <strong>30 个日历日内</strong>尝试解决（双方可另约更长期限）。同时，§ 541.5 规定：<strong>缺少必需发票信息的账单，被开票方无付款义务</strong>——这条对转嫁方是双刃剑：它约束上游承运人，也约束货代自己转开的下游账单。</p>\n<p>当内部争议无法解决时，货方可依 46 U.S.C. § 41310 向 FMC 提出投诉；若委员会认定发票不准确或虚假，§ 41107 的罚款与退款条款适用（46 U.S.C. § 41104(d)）。实践中更有效的顺序是：<strong>先做发票合规检查</strong>（缺字段即可拒付）→ <strong>再用举证做份额抗辩</strong> → <strong>最后才进入 FMC 投诉</strong>。三步的证据链高度重叠，因此把发票字段、事件时间戳、闸口日志存在同一个可追溯的数据结构里，是唯一能同时支撑三条路径的做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>D&amp;D 责任归属的核心是&quot;正当权益方&quot;与激励原则：费用应开给对提箱/还箱有实际控制力的主体（FMC 85 FR 29638，2020）。</li>\n<li>提单 Merchant 条款让承运人合同上有权向任一货方开票，它是货代频繁收到非自身责任账单的根源。</li>\n<li>NVOCC 转嫁受两条硬约束：30 日开票期限（§ 541.7）与 safe harbor（46 U.S.C. § 41104(e)），且可同时是开票方与被开票方。</li>\n<li>车队场景的三条规则——闸口拒收免责、货方原因自担、举证决定谁付——与 2026 年特区巡回法院维持的 FMC 裁定一致。</li>\n<li>转嫁失败后的追偿按&quot;发票合规检查 → 份额举证抗辩 → FMC 投诉&quot;三步走，§ 541.5 的缺字段免责是第一步的抓手。</li>\n<li>系统层面应把责任矩阵结构化，让转嫁账单的归属份额由规则引擎计算，而非事后人工争论。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"费用责任归属与跨主体转嫁（货主/货代/车队/收货人）机制","id":"费用责任归属与跨主体转嫁-货主-货代-车队-收货人-机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：正当权益方、Merchant 与责任链","id":"核心概念-正当权益方-merchant-与责任链"},{"level":2,"text":"转嫁路径：NVOCC 的 pass-through 与法定安全港","id":"转嫁路径-nvocc-的-pass-through-与法定安全港"},{"level":2,"text":"车队责任切片：merchant haulage 下的 Detention 归属","id":"车队责任切片-merchant-haulage-下的-detention-归属"},{"level":2,"text":"合同前置：把责任分配写进条款而非事后吵","id":"合同前置-把责任分配写进条款而非事后吵"},{"level":2,"text":"争议与坏账：转嫁失败后的追偿路径","id":"争议与坏账-转嫁失败后的追偿路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"承运人费率表、免费期条款与阶梯计费契约建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/dd-charge-regime-commercial-model/carrier-tariff-free-time-contract-terms"},"next":{"title":"免费期时钟模型与集装箱全生命周期事件时间线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/free-time-clock-event-tracking/dd-clock-model-container-event-timeline"}}